{"v":1,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","layout":"pages","chapters":[{"id":"cover","title":"Azizi the doll","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/01.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"h","x":"Azizi the doll"}]},{"id":"p1","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/02.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"This is Azizi. Azizi is my doll."}]},{"id":"p2","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/03.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I like Azizi because he always smiles."}]},{"id":"p3","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/04.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"After I wake up I wash my face. Then I look for Azizi."}]},{"id":"p4","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/05.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"When I find Azizi I brush his hair."}]},{"id":"p5","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/06.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"When I eat breakfast I feed Azizi."}]},{"id":"p6","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/07.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"When I eat sweets I give one to Azizi."}]},{"id":"p7","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/08.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"But Azizi never eats his sweet. I wonder why!"}]},{"id":"p8","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/09.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I walk around the compound picking flowers."}]},{"id":"p9","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/10.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I give a flower to Azizi. But he never says, \"Thank you.\""}]},{"id":"p10","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/11.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I wash Azizi clean before my mother bathes me."}]},{"id":"p11","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/12.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"I dress Azizi in red because I love the colour red."}]},{"id":"p12","title":"","blocks":[{"t":"img","src":"/books/img/0099/13.jpg","alt":""},{"t":"p","x":"When I go to sleep, I lay Azizi beside me."}]}]}